  "description": "Canadian open-source electronic medical record system developed at McMaster University Department of Family Medicine, widely used by primary care and family medicine clinics across Canada. Java-based, GPL v2+ licensed. Covers scheduling, charting, prescriptions, billing (provincial), labs, and preventive care. ISO 13485:2016 certified. Now exclusively distributed and maintained by WELL EMR Group (formerly Doctors Services Group) as 'OSCAR Pro', with the canonical McMaster source code available on Bitbucket. Thousands of Canadian physicians use OSCAR or OSCAR Pro.",
